  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">오늘은~ 기체의 용해도에 관련된 실험입니다ㅎㅎ<br>온도에 따른 기체 용해도를 알아볼겁니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/93d73fc61dcea3b1428cb47072343b1a7f4a199f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/93d73fc61dcea3b1428cb47072343b1a7f4a199f\" data-origin-width=\"621\" data-origin-height=\"284\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aaa9bbca689f8245d0379eb2d5f856c1b94fc41c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aaa9bbca689f8245d0379eb2d5f856c1b94fc41c\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1485\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7770a10366fcf7d52177bfcf37f68bd9379f8739\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7770a10366fcf7d52177bfcf37f68bd9379f8739\" data-origin-width=\"1023\" data-origin-height=\"1482\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">말 그대로 탄산음료의 온도가 높아짐에 따라<br>이산화탄소가 방출되면 열량계 내부의<br>이산화탄소 농도가 높아집니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/36007720299a42d17f8f3eddf09798c5e590dc85\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/36007720299a42d17f8f3eddf09798c5e590dc85\" data-origin-width=\"1022\" data-origin-height=\"1473\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d8c4f7690ef90b35c9b5c1a5c583c825909f8f93\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d8c4f7690ef90b35c9b5c1a5c583c825909f8f93\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1478\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e6d7f8f8d455f0a7fa02be2bc615e07f3e066461\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e6d7f8f8d455f0a7fa02be2bc615e07f3e066461\" data-origin-width=\"1012\" data-origin-height=\"400\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">글쓰면서 지금와서 생각해보면....<br>진공 만드는 장치에 콜라 한 컵이랑<br>이산화탄소 센서, 기압센서를 넣어두고<br>공기를 빼면...<br>기압이 낮아짐에 따라 이산화탄소가 <br>더 많이 배출되는 것도 센서 측정값으로 <br>볼 수 있겠네요..?<br><br>바로 실험하러 갑니다.<br><br>[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그\" data-og-description=\"영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다\" data-og-host=\"m.blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bM4lMN/dJMb8PGuo7F/v1esudWDtZdySP3rq1xe2k/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bM4lMN/dJMb8PGuo7F/v1esudWDtZdySP3rq1xe2k/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그</p><p class=\"og-desc\">영서중학교 과학교사(